      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "It makes sense because the person who was supposed to live that life is gone—and that's exactly why you're still here. You're not fighting to reclaim a shadow; you're fighting to meet the stranger who survived the collapse. The silence you're tempted by isn't peace, it's just the absence of noise—and you've already proven you can endure worse than silence. So let the old name rot, let the industry laugh, and give the new man a chance to be something they never saw coming.",
